{"name":"Café au Lait","hex":"#a57c5b","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"café au lait","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Coffee mixed with hot milk as a drink; white coffee;  a serving of this.","Coffee and hot milk served in separate jugs as a breakfast drink;  a serving of this."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a light brown colour like that of coffee with milk.","Of a person: having skin of a light brown colour; also, of a person's skin: having this colour; often  due to mixed black and white parentage or ancestry."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/caf%C3%A9_au_lait"}],"entries":[{"title":"Café au lait","blocks":[{"text":"Café au lait is coffee with hot milk added. It differs from white coffee, which is coffee with cold milk or other whiteners added."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Caf%C3%A9_au_lait.jpg/330px-Caf%C3%A9_au_lait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caf%C3%A9_au_lait","wikidata":"Q259109"},{"title":"Coffee (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Coffee is a brownish color that is a representation of a roasted coffee bean. Different types of coffee beans have different colors when roasted—the color coffee represents an average."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Roasted_coffee_beans.jpg/330px-Roasted_coffee_beans.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee_(color)","wikidata":"Q2932937"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Caf%C3%A9_au_lait.jpg/500px-Caf%C3%A9_au_lait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Caf%C3%A9_au_lait.jpg/1280px-Caf%C3%A9_au_lait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wiki